<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="yes"?>
<catalogue id="3f53-22a2-ab40-fccb" name="Halo - Forerunner" revision="1" battleScribeVersion="2.03" library="false" gameSystemId="6f3b-423b-f7e2-caee" gameSystemRevision="1" xmlns="http://www.battlescribe.net/schema/catalogueSchema"><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="19b6-88dd-30a4-32c6" name="Army Setup" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade"><constraints><constraint type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="6b44-320c-c6f2-5d7e"/><constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="b5ef-a676-7677-4c4d"/></constraints><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="aaaa-c65c-9127-06de" name="Army Setup" hidden="false" targetId="a02c-b714-98ad-b8e8" primary="true"/></categoryLinks><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="8480-4a1d-fa1b-d476" name="Army: Forerunner" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="aa56-fbbe-c79f-abb0"/></constraints><rules><rule id="cb4d-d8ba-1841-f2c5" name="Counter-Assault Protocols" hidden="false"><description>When an ambush or unactivated Forerunner Infantry unit is assaulted by enemy Infantry or Artillery, it may react with a Fire order, treating itself as being on Ambush when determining whether it can react. If any attacking models survive and complete the assault, the assaulting unit halves its total number of attack dice, rounding up, during the first round of that Close Quarters combat only.</description></rule><rule id="5650-1a67-2b4d-b596" name="Uphold the Mantle" hidden="false"><description>Any Veteran Forerunner unit that passes an Order test may remove 2 Pin markers instead of 1.</description></rule><rule id="bada-c191-d72e-241b" name="Warden of Balance" hidden="false"><description>At the beginning of each turn, if your opponent has more units on the battlefield than you, select one friendly Forerunner Infantry or Artillery unit from your army list. During this turn, that unit gains +1 to hit when shooting. This does not stack across turns and expires at the end of each turn.</description></rule><rule id="9574-6a21-ac32-1019" name="Teleportation Network" hidden="false"><description>Each time a Forerunner Officer successfully uses You men, snap to action!, you may choose one friendly Infantry or Artillery unit that is being issued an order by that Snap. The order issued to that unit cannot be Advance, Run, or Assault. A unit carrying an objective cannot be chosen. If the chosen unit is required to take an Order test (e.g., because it is pinned), resolve the test as normal: 

  * Failed:
The unit goes Down (or follows FUBAR if applicable) as normal and does not teleport.

  * Passed (or if no Order test is required):
The unit teleports up to 12&quot;, ignoring intervening units and terrain. It may not end in impassable terrain, inside a building, outside the battlefield, or within 1&quot; of any unit. Teleporting does not trigger enemy Ambush during this movement. After teleporting, the unit resolves its assigned order (Fire, Ambush, Down, or Rally) as normal.</description></rule></rules></selectionEntry></selectionEntries></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="8073-62d0-821e-2958" name="Officer - Sub-monitor (Platoon commander)" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="unit"><profiles><profile id="846d-9731-862c-bce4" name="Officer - Sub-monitor (Platoon commander)" hidden="false" typeId="4f99-c622-96b9-db14" typeName="Unit"><modifiers><modifier type="increment" field="c162-476c-a031-003b" value="1"><repeats><repeat value="1" repeats="1" field="selections" scope="8073-62d0-821e-2958" childId="c3d0-6e3f-4ca4-8cbe" shared="true" roundUp="false" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false"/></repeats></modifier><modifier type="decrement" field="c162-476c-a031-003b" value="1"/><modifier type="set" field="f2ee-ef5c-ac2f-0a29" value="3+"><conditions><condition type="atLeast" value="1" field="selections" scope="8073-62d0-821e-2958" childId="08f6-0401-97f7-f0ee" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false"/></conditions></modifier><modifier type="set" field="f2ee-ef5c-ac2f-0a29" value="5+"><conditions><condition type="atLeast" value="1" field="selections" scope="8073-62d0-821e-2958" childId="269d-51c9-e684-0321" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false"/></conditions></modifier></modifiers><characteristics><characteristic name="Type" typeId="edb9-a03d-e44e-2632">Infantry</characteristic><characteristic name="Models" typeId="c162-476c-a031-003b">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Damage Value" typeId="f2ee-ef5c-ac2f-0a29">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Transport" typeId="5d1c-b220-d676-62fa">–</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="e295-0b32-96e2-0212" name="Sentinel Beam" hidden="false" typeId="687b-50c6-e68d-9ed8" typeName="Weapon"><modifiers><modifier type="increment" field="1c44-f79c-f5d5-65a2" value="1"><repeats><repeat value="1" repeats="1" field="selections" scope="8073-62d0-821e-2958" childId="c3d0-6e3f-4ca4-8cbe" shared="true" roundUp="false" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false"/></repeats></modifier><modifier type="decrement" field="1c44-f79c-f5d5-65a2" value="1"/></modifiers><characteristics><characteristic name="Qty" typeId="1c44-f79c-f5d5-65a2">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Range" typeId="88e2-96b8-e9cf-cb86">24&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Shots" typeId="164a-51d2-e474-ab4c">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Pen" typeId="d266-c548-f63b-0ea2">–</characteristic><characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="0bf8-e72d-45f4-c21d">–</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><infoLinks><infoLink id="0b86-b833-048b-607d" name="Platoon Commander" hidden="false" targetId="d64b-7cdb-29ec-6b71" type="rule"/><infoLink id="3c57-977a-70d7-47d1" name="Flight" hidden="false" targetId="ee90-a0ce-da69-8d5c" type="rule"/><infoLink id="22d3-7320-af34-5449" name="Composed Beings" hidden="false" targetId="2216-3794-2c1f-4906" type="rule"/><infoLink id="1f02-2ac8-ecee-a462" name="Energy Shield" hidden="false" targetId="07f3-cda4-4add-de67" type="rule"/><infoLink id="7b07-b9d7-8fc4-3191" name="Stubborn" hidden="false" targetId="56f4-3674-15fc-d3a9" type="rule"/></infoLinks><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="3100-bffa-718a-7906" name="Headquarters" hidden="false" targetId="072a-e3cb-07ca-60af" primary="true"/><categoryLink id="1666-7106-e0a9-8c63" name="Platoon Commander" hidden="false" targetId="de03-be30-08bc-3183" primary="false"/><categoryLink id="4f6b-0815-4058-7447" name="Transport Allowance Unit" hidden="false" targetId="c868-ee48-0704-5a98" primary="false"/><categoryLink id="93a3-8c